    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>UltraGreek Ticker displays a scrolling ticker with manual messages you enter in the admin panel.</p>\n<h3>Usage</h3>\n<p>Go to <code>UltraGreek Ticker</code> in the admin menu and add your Label + Text 1-5.</p>\n<p>Enable Auto Placement to show the ticker above or below the header.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the folder <code>my-ticker</code> to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.10.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Rename plugin display name and slug.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.10</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release (manual-only).</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
